{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And it burned to Cain, etc.</b> Now, the burning anger indicates exaltation, and the falling of the face indicates abasement. The burning anger was directed against his brother, who had ascended in rank while he himself had gone down, because he thought that he was the cause — for he had brought an offering more select and superior to his, and through his agency the deficiency of his own offering was exposed. And the abasement was through his recognition of his lowliness in the eyes of HaShem." "It further intends along this line: <b>and it burned to Cain</b> — when he saw that HaShem did not accept his offering, for this declares that the Creator despises His creations and does not watch over them; therefore he became angry. And this trait belongs to idolaters, as it says (Isaiah 8:21): ״וְהָיָה כִי יִרְעַב וְהִתְקַצַּף״ — against his god who does not watch over him. And when he saw that HaShem attended to Abel and not to him, then his face fell, and he knew that it was not from the side of the Watcher but from the side of the watched that the cause lay to withhold favor from him. And his brother testifies to two things: he testifies that HaShem does watch over, and he testifies that Cain is deprived of favor — for they were two offerings and one disqualification." "The verse further alludes to what they of blessed memory said (Zohar vol. 2, 182a) that whoever becomes angry, his soul departs from him. And this dimension relates to the image of Elohim upon the face of man, and that is what the verse means by <b>and it burned to Cain</b> — and through this his face fell: that the soul departed from him and the image of the face was removed from him. And the reason for his abasement in the eyes of HaShem is that even though his sin was not yet known, his deeds testify that he was wicked."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:39:15.021697268Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}